          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screen_Shot_2024-04-08_at_12.21.20_PM.png",
            "title": "“Homeschool is professional in every way and the teachers are fabulous! But by far the most helpful are the weekly lessons and 15 minute check-ins. It’s really me that they’re teaching so I can then teach/train my dog. Bruno is happier and more relaxed since I signed up for Homeschool. I really liked the zoom lessons, too. It was simple and in-person truly wasn’t necessary. I highly recommend Homeschool!\"",
            "text": "<p>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</p><p><strong>Frances & Bruno</strong><br/>Berkely, CA</p>",
