          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screen_Shot_2024-04-08_at_12.13.40_PM.png",
            "title": "\"When we started, she was having accidents and destroying her crate all the time. And now she’s completely fine and is very comfortable in her space. I’m constantly impressed by how much she’ll stay and wait for us. She’s way better on a leash. I’m very happy with what we learned.\"",
