        "heading_highlight_type": "circle",
        "heading_size": 120,
        "text_content": "Based on your dog's breed, adoption story, and training knowledge, our team (no bots here!) will create a unique plan with weekly milestones and homework designed to meet your goals. Say goodby to generic group classes and hello to tailored 1:1 learning.",
